{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19911","headline":"秋怀 六 · 孟郊","name":"秋怀 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老骨惧秋月，秋月刀劒棱。\n纤辉不可干，冷魂坐自凝。\n羇雌巢空镜，仙飙荡浮冰。\n惊步恐自翻，病大不敢凌。\n单床寤皎皎，瘦卧心兢兢。\n洗河不见水，透浊爲清澄。\n诗壮昔空说，诗衰今何凭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19911.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19911","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}